@startuml
title DMS - Use Case Workflow Dokumen

left to right direction

actor "Pegawai" as Pegawai
actor "PPK" as PPK
actor "PPSPM" as PPSPM

rectangle "Workflow Dokumen" {
  package "Pengajuan Pegawai" {
    usecase "Ajukan Dokumen Material" as UCAjukanMaterial
    usecase "Simpan Dokumen Non-Material" as UCSimpanNonMaterial
    usecase "Upload Lampiran" as UCUpload
    usecase "Revisi Dokumen" as UCRevisi
    usecase "Ajukan Ulang Dokumen" as UCAjukanUlang
  }

  package "Pemantauan Dokumen" {
    usecase "Lihat Status Dokumen" as UCStatus
    usecase "Lihat Riwayat Aktivitas" as UCRiwayat
    usecase "Preview / Download Lampiran Terotorisasi" as UCFile
  }

  package "Validasi PPK" {
    usecase "Lihat Inbox Validasi" as UCInboxPPK
    usecase "Validasi Dokumen" as UCValidasi
    usecase "Minta Revisi ke Pegawai" as UCMintaRevisi
    usecase "Teruskan ke PPSPM" as UCTeruskan
  }

  package "Persetujuan PPSPM" {
    usecase "Lihat Inbox Persetujuan" as UCInboxPPSPM
    usecase "Setujui Dokumen" as UCSetujui
    usecase "Kembalikan ke PPK" as UCKembalikan
  }
}

Pegawai --> UCAjukanMaterial
Pegawai --> UCSimpanNonMaterial
Pegawai --> UCUpload
Pegawai --> UCRevisi
Pegawai --> UCAjukanUlang
Pegawai --> UCStatus
Pegawai --> UCRiwayat
Pegawai --> UCFile

PPK --> UCInboxPPK
PPK --> UCValidasi
PPK --> UCMintaRevisi
PPK --> UCTeruskan
PPK --> UCRiwayat
PPK --> UCFile

PPSPM --> UCInboxPPSPM
PPSPM --> UCSetujui
PPSPM --> UCKembalikan
PPSPM --> UCRiwayat
PPSPM --> UCFile

note bottom
  Material: DRAFT -> IN_PPK_VALIDATION -> IN_BENDAHARA_APPROVAL -> COMPLETED.
  Label pengguna tetap PPSPM meskipun status internal memakai IN_BENDAHARA_APPROVAL.
  Non-material: DRAFT -> TERSIMPAN.
  Metadata dokumen material selesai, seperti nominal_realisasi, tidak diedit.
end note

@enduml
